      "name": "[DGF] Image and Icons",
      "settings": {
        "section_title": "<h2>MEET BOSWELLIA COMPLEX: The Ancient Healer Your Joints Have Been Waiting For</h2>",
        "section_subtitle": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: -0.5rem !important;\">For over 5,000 years, Boswellia Serrata resin — known as Indian Frankincense or Shallaki in Ayurveda — has been used as the ancient healer to soothe discomfort, restore ease of movement, and support long-term joint health.<br><br>\n\nTraditional Ayurvedic practitioners relied on Boswellia to:</p>\n<li>Support recovery after long days of physical work</li>\n<li>Soothe aches from repetitive motion</li>\n<li>Maintain flexibility and comfortable joints</li><br><br>\n<p>Today, modern research confirms what ancient practitioners recognized — Boswellia’s unique boswellic acids, especially AKBA, help support joint comfort, healthy inflammatory response and improved daily movement. When paired with Ginger Root Extract and BioPerine® for enhanced absorption, the result is one of the most effective natural formulas for joint comfort, mobility, and overall vitality.<sup>*</sup></p>",
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/boswellia-text.webp",
        "column_title": "<b>Powerful benefits of <span>BOSWELLIA COMPLEX</span></b>",
        "mobile_column_title_primary": "<b>Powerful benefits of</b>",
        "mobile_column_title_secondary": "<span><b>BOSWELLIA COMPLEX</b></span>",
        "bg_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "padding_top": 40,
